WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:02.250
- OK, running back committee, help yourselves to some pastries.

00:00:02.333 --> 00:00:03.833
- [Speaking over each other:] FEED ME. FEED ME.

00:00:03.958 --> 00:00:04.375
- I’m not hungry right now. 

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.208
- I’M SO FED, I’M GOING TO YAC.

00:00:06.416 --> 00:00:07.708
That’s a yards-after-catch joke.

00:00:10.458 --> 00:00:14.083
- Our Q3 numbers are strong, but QBs are trending towards throwing the ball in Q4.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:15.708
- Ah, interesting.
- Curious.
- I hate it when they throw.

00:00:15.791 --> 00:00:16.833
- I’M MY WHOLE TEAM NOW.

00:00:17.208 --> 00:00:18.750
- Settle down. You’re acting like real receivers. 

00:00:19.041 --> 00:00:19.833
- IT’S NOT THAT HARD:

00:00:19.875 --> 00:00:22.875
THROW THE BALL WELL ENOUGH TO CATCH BUT BAD ENOUGH THAT WE LOOK COOL.

00:00:23.291 --> 00:00:24.666
- Yo, what do I pay the pizza guy, like a million?

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.708
- And this is why holding out works.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:29.083
I made less money, and now I play for the Jets.

00:00:29.166 --> 00:00:30.083
- Cool.
- Cool.
- Thanks for sharing.

00:00:30.125 --> 00:00:32.541
- WHO NEEDS CONTRACTS? JUST PLAY FOR 40 YEARS. 

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:34.458
- The chair recognizes the Niners subcommittee.

00:00:34.541 --> 00:00:36.666
- [In unison:] Deep dive. Circle back. Synergy.

00:00:36.708 --> 00:00:38.541
- Next order of business: How is Chubb growing?

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:39.375
- Uhh...

00:00:39.458 --> 00:00:42.500
- HOW DARE THE HATERS SAY WE %@!#&amp;!$ SUCK JUST BECAUSE WE %@!#&amp;!$ SUCK.

00:00:42.583 --> 00:00:43.583
- Maybe I’m the star.

00:00:43.708 --> 00:00:44.083
Fine. 

00:00:44.333 --> 00:00:46.375
- Rapid-fire ideas to increase value: Go.

00:00:46.625 --> 00:00:48.500
- WE NEED QBS THAT DON’T DO WHAT WE DO.

00:00:48.583 --> 00:00:50.375
- NOSE PIERCINGS, ARM TAPES, AIRHEADS.

00:00:50.416 --> 00:00:53.000
- FOUR P.M. SHOULD BE DINNER TIME, NOT GAME TIME.

00:00:53.208 --> 00:00:54.291
- All right, gentlemen, meeting adjourned.

00:00:55.583 --> 00:00:57.166
- WHY DOES HE GET MORE PIZZA THAN ME?

00:00:57.250 --> 00:00:59.916
- IT’S THE SAME AMOUNT OF PIZZA. I JUST DO MORE WITH IT!

00:01:02.666 --> 00:01:06.000
- I'm Eli, and lately I've had some time to learn about the internet.

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:08.625
You can subscribe below, whatever that means.

00:01:08.666 --> 00:01:11.083
Here let me type in Eli Manni—

00:01:11.125 --> 00:01:12.791
Oh, no....

